error[E0091]: 'for ... in ...' yields an index (slice/array) or a key (map); 'string' has neither (§13.1)
  --> check_forin_unsupported.bit:13:12
   |
13 |   for c in s { println("${c}") }
   |            ^ iterate values with 'for x of ...' instead, or index/key it explicitly
